WEBVTT

NOTE
title: Go-live readiness review
type: review
language: en
participants:
- Thomas Girard | Data Platform Lead | Voltaria
- Claire Dubois | Head of Customer Operations | Voltaria
- Nadia Benali | Retention Product Owner | Voltaria
- Hugo Lambert | Engagement Manager | Consulting team
- Léa Moreau | Data Engineer | Consulting team

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.000
<v Hugo Lambert>This is the readiness review for the go-live planned on September 15th. Thomas, where do we stand?</v>

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:38.000
<v Thomas Girard>Bad news first: the load test of the campaign tool failed yesterday. At 14,000 customers in scope, the tool times out when it generates the call lists.</v>

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:54.000
<v Léa Moreau>The scoring pipeline itself is fine, it scores the full Essentielle base in under ten minutes. The bottleneck is only the campaign tool.</v>

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:10.000
<v Thomas Girard>The vendor has a fix, but I need a few days to apply it and rerun the load test.</v>

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:28.000
<v Claire Dubois>I'd rather postpone than go live with a tool that breaks in front of the agents.</v>

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:45.000
<v Hugo Lambert>Agreed. So we postpone the go-live by one week, to September 22nd, because of the failed load test.</v>

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:58.000
<v Nadia Benali>Fine for the business. I'll inform the retention team today.</v>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:12.000
<v Thomas Girard>I'll rerun the load test with the fix by September 18th.</v>

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:30.000
<v Claire Dubois>And I'll staff six additional retention agents for the go-live week.</v>

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:41.000
<v Hugo Lambert>Thanks. Next checkpoint on the 18th after the load test.</v>
